@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+CORE2-SLP-fixed
+
+This version is based on the uploaded CORE-CORE2-SLP code and fixes the issues observed in the previous experiment:
+
+1. No-long-term episode handling is now clean. When use_long_term=False, any done=True immediately terminates and resets the episode. The legacy real_done / step_calculator waiting logic is only active when use_long_term=True. A hard max_steps cap is also enforced in tools.simulate().
+2. slp_score_key is changed from obs_reward to score, so SLP landmarks are mined from MineCLIP/semantic score instead of sparse environment reward. The score fallback order now prefers score and score_on_zoomed before obs_reward.
+3. Actor diagnostics are added: actor_entropy_*, actor_logprob_*, actor_loss_before_entropy, actor_entropy_loss, actor_loss_total, and value_loss_total.
+4. The accidental duplicate dynamics.img_step() call in ImagBehavior._imagine() is removed.
+
+Expected key config:
+  use_original_intrinsic: False
+  use_long_term: False
+  use_wm_progress_reward: False
+  use_slp_reward: True
+  slp_score_key: 'score'
+
+Expected logs include slp_* metrics and actor_entropy_* metrics. Train/eval lengths should not exceed the episode max in no-long-term mode.
